{"conversationId":50,"title":"Sordland/Turn04/InT_SSCHighwayIssue","storyPack":"StoryPack_Main","turn":4,"turnLabel":"Turn 4","isDevNote":false,"rootNodeId":0,"nodes":{"0":{"id":0,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":1}]},"1":{"id":1,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":4}]},"2":{"id":2,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[]},"3":{"id":3,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"But the main purpose of our visit was to solve construction issues that began to endanger the deadline.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":6}]},"4":{"id":4,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The H-3 Highway construction created a second opportunity to visit the seaside town of Lenkurg known for its salmon. Thousands of people from the city were employed for construction work by the new highway project.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":3}]},"5":{"id":5,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"There also was a message of support from the mayor of Arvory, Eric Niel, who was grateful for the H-3 investments.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":50}]},"6":{"id":6,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":7},{"convId":50,"nodeId":8}]},"7":{"id":7,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":9}]},"8":{"id":8,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":10}]},"9":{"id":9,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The mayor welcomed us to his own mansion and praised us for our decision to extensively invest in the Agnland region.","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":71}]},"10":{"id":10,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"We first met with the mayor and took a brief tour in the city.","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Decision_Turn04_RegionalInvestment_Agnland","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":16}]},"11":{"id":11,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The meeting ended. The three of us went to the beach of Lenkurg. It was rather rocky, but very pristine. The sunset looked absolutely astonishing over the Markian Sea.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":12}]},"12":{"id":12,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The day-long visit ended with a dinner involving the most important people in the city. Many of them were bureaucrats.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":14}]},"13":{"id":13,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“That should be it. Good that we have figured out a way to move the process forward.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":11}]},"14":{"id":14,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Later, we made our way back to Holsord.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":79}]},"15":{"id":15,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"GameCondition.Turn04_InT_Issue","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":95}]},"16":{"id":16,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Afterwards, we gathered at the city hall. Symon had a worried look on his face.","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Reform_EmergencyDecree_SuspendedProtests\"] == false) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Reform_EmergencyDecree_SuspendedProtests","op":"==","value":"false"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":5}]},"17":{"id":17,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Trust me Mr. President this is the best investment we could have done. The SSC will only grow and learn from this.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_HighwayIssue_Solved","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGame.GovernmentBudget","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.GovernmentBudget\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":94}]},"18":{"id":18,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“This extra investment could be just enough to get things back on track. However, it is unfortunate we had to spend more because we need it elsewhere too.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_Issue_SSC_Money","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn04_Infrastructure_SSCFunds","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":75}]},"19":{"id":19,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I'm not so sure what a warning can do to the situation on the ground. The managers already have many issues to tackle.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Public_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Public_Opinion\"] + 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":13}]},"20":{"id":20,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“The state owns the SSC. They can't retaliate and bite off the hand that feeds them.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":61}]},"21":{"id":21,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Symon took a deep breath and continued.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":35}]},"22":{"id":22,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“With more resources the managers are more likely to hit the deadline. Any other action just hurts Sordland.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":29},{"convId":50,"nodeId":31},{"convId":50,"nodeId":30}]},"23":{"id":23,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_Issue_SSC_Money","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn04_Infrastructure_SSCFunds","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":18}]},"24":{"id":24,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_Issue_SSC_Warn","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn04_Infrastructure_SSCWarning","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":60}]},"25":{"id":25,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_Issue_SSC_Replace","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn04_Infrastructure_SSCReplaced","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":44}]},"26":{"id":26,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“This was a bad decision. This hurts the honorable SSC more than anything and will hamper our efforts.”","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Situation_Law_MediaBias\"] == true) and ((Variable[\"BaseGame.Situation_Law_MediaBias\"] == true) == false)","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Situation_Law_MediaBias","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Public_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Public_Opinion\"] + 1"},{"var":"BaseGame.Public_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Public_Opinion\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":13}]},"27":{"id":27,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Couldn't agree more. This shouldn't keep going on any longer.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":32}]},"28":{"id":28,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I stand in agreement. The construction speed can recover if they expand the workforce and buy new machinery.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":34}]},"29":{"id":29,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Give more money to the construction managers so they can hire more workers and buy machinery to hit the deadline.” [-1 Government Budget]","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":23}]},"30":{"id":30,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Replace the construction managers with more competent people to ensure the deadline is hit.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":25}]},"31":{"id":31,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Warn the construction managers. Send a formal warning from the Ministry of Economy and the Presidency.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":24}]},"32":{"id":32,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It is very important that we create jobs for our own citizens who are unemployed rather than foreigners.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":39},{"convId":50,"nodeId":41},{"convId":50,"nodeId":20}]},"33":{"id":33,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“We can either give the construction managers money, warn them or replace them.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":22}]},"34":{"id":34,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“A cash injection would increase the project costs even further.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":36},{"convId":50,"nodeId":38},{"convId":50,"nodeId":39}]},"35":{"id":35,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“One way or another we have to solve this issue. This can lead to real complications down the line otherwise.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":33}]},"36":{"id":36,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“It might even be necessary for us to hit the opening date.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":43}]},"37":{"id":37,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“There is a good chance that they will take it far more seriously and take measures to increase speed.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":21}]},"38":{"id":38,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“There is also the chance that the money could be wasted. We already spent so much on this investment.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":42}]},"39":{"id":39,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Giving them a serious warning could be the solution. A slap on the wrist can do wonders.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":37}]},"40":{"id":40,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The state warning the state doesn't make any sense at all anyway. Their reasons are just.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":21}]},"41":{"id":41,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Officially warning them is a possibility but isn't tangible, we need action.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":40}]},"42":{"id":42,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I can only hope that they handle the money well if they do get it. I'm still not fully convinced.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":21}]},"43":{"id":43,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“If we make the opening ceremony on time the public will cherish our efficiency.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":21}]},"44":{"id":44,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It's good to see that failure isn't rewarded and punished. We will find more competent people through our networks.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_Issue_SSC_Replace","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn04_Infrastructure_SSCReplaced","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":89}]},"45":{"id":45,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It would be a drastic measure but not unreasonable. Replacing them with competent managers would do.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":47}]},"46":{"id":46,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“You see that the likes of Underhall are willing to bend the rules and risk the lives of their workers to hit deadlines. The SSC abides by the rules and regulations.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":62}]},"47":{"id":47,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I disagree completely. The SSC managers are the most experienced construction managers in Sordland.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":41},{"convId":50,"nodeId":20},{"convId":50,"nodeId":48}]},"48":{"id":48,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Finding competent managers could work. New blood can move things back on track.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":49}]},"49":{"id":49,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“We have a lot of talented construction managers in the private industry who would work for us in the SSC.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":21}]},"50":{"id":50,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I have concerns about the construction due to progress being slower than expected.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":52}]},"51":{"id":51,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“The SSC might need more resources to speed things up. That deadline must be met.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":28}]},"52":{"id":52,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“We scheduled the project to finish in late 1955 but the Sordish State Corporation might miss that target with the current trajectory.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":70}]},"53":{"id":53,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“We can't let mismanagement delay the project. It is unacceptable.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":27}]},"54":{"id":54,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The SSC is an organisation of principle so they aren't rushing and risking peoples lives. The state can't be reckless.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":58},{"convId":50,"nodeId":65},{"convId":50,"nodeId":64},{"convId":50,"nodeId":57}]},"55":{"id":55,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“The managers should be fired. This is unacceptable.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":45}]},"56":{"id":56,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“But with that comes other issues. We don't want to create chaos in the management team which could create further problems.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":51},{"convId":50,"nodeId":53},{"convId":50,"nodeId":55}]},"57":{"id":57,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I trust that the SSC will accomplish it in time.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":69}]},"58":{"id":58,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“How can we get the construction back on schedule?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":59}]},"59":{"id":59,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“That is the million ren question. There are a couple of issues that need to be resolved if we want the SSC to make the deadline.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":62}]},"60":{"id":60,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The warning will hopefully have a positive result to their performance. We could escalate further later.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_Issue_SSC_Warn","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn04_Infrastructure_SSCWarning","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":88}]},"61":{"id":61,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Why would they? The SSC respects the authorities fully. They would never dare to go against us.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":21}]},"62":{"id":62,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“One of the important issues is their construction management team. The other could be the outdated construction methods used which require more manpower, but we aren't sure if that contributes to the issue.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":56}]},"63":{"id":63,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn04_InT_HighwayIssue_Solved","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":17}]},"64":{"id":64,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I don't care about principles, our agreed opening dates must be met.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":66}]},"65":{"id":65,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“This doesn't raise confidence at all. Maybe we shouldn't have picked the SSC.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":46}]},"66":{"id":66,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“We shouldn't be risking lives, Mr. President. The SSC wouldn't slow construction down if it wasn't absolutely necessary.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":67}]},"67":{"id":67,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Either way we need them to solve the issue at hand.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":51},{"convId":50,"nodeId":53},{"convId":50,"nodeId":55}]},"68":{"id":68,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Worth considering because I'm not confident that they will hit their targets.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":51},{"convId":50,"nodeId":53},{"convId":50,"nodeId":55}]},"69":{"id":69,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I think so too but maybe we should increase their budget to help them buy new machinery to speed up the process.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":68}]},"70":{"id":70,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“After engaging with the managers, they have said that they are moving forward slowly but steadily. The cliff-side ground-laying construction between Lenkurg and Arvory is proving more dangerous than expected.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":54}]},"71":{"id":71,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":50,"nodeId":72},{"convId":50,"nodeId":73}]},"72":{"id":72,"speaker":"Symon Holl","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Reform_EmergencyDecree_Suspende